B.ZO=new A.kl(B.e7,"Red Team",B.cT,"GHOSTLOAD","Werewolf","The hooded infiltrator with a rogue USB key.","Every night, together.","Know each other. Each night they silently agree on one employee to compromise. They cannot target a fellow Red Team member.",!1)
B.ZR=new A.kl(B.f6,"Defender",B.aT,"BULWARK","Villager","The frontline guard, shield up.","Never.","No special power. Wins through logic, observation and the vote.",!1)
B.ZQ=new A.kl(B.cg,"Threat Hunter",B.aT,"TRACER","Seer","The seeker, radar always on.","Every night.","Points at one player. The Narrator silently shows them that player's role card.",!0)
B.ZS=new A.kl(B.f7,"SOC Analyst",B.aT,"NIGHTWATCH","Little Girl","The 24/7 monitoring operator.","Never called, may peek.","May slightly open their eyes during the Red Team's turn. If caught, the Red Team may target them.",!0)
B.ZT=new A.kl(B.c_,"Incident Responder",B.aT,"RESPAWN","Witch","Backup case in one hand, kill switch in the other.","Every night, after the Red Team.","Sees tonight's victim. Two single-use tools: Backup Restore (save the victim) and Kill Process (eliminate any player). Each once per game; they may save themselves.",!0)
B.ZN=new A.kl(B.dr,"Dead Man's Switch",B.aT,"FAILSAFE","Hunter","Armed, timer at 00:00.","Only when eliminated.","When it goes down, it immediately takes one player of its choice down with it.",!0)
B.ZU=new A.kl(B.cM,"Network Engineer",B.aT,"LINKSMITH","Cupid","Cable on the shoulder, RJ45 in hand.","First night only.","Links two players with a VPN Tunnel. If one goes down, the other goes down too. Linked players never vote against each other.",!0)
B.ZP=new A.kl(B.ds,"Purple Team",B.cU,"DUALBOOT","White Werewolf","Half red, half blue, loyal to no one.","Every night with the Red Team + alone every second night.","Seen by the Red Team as one of their own. Every second night it may eliminate one Red Team member. Wins by being the last player standing.",!0)
