B.Oq=new A.ik(1,"Security Audit",B.jf,"Tonight","An external security audit gives the Blue Team more resources to investigate.","Tonight the Threat Hunter may inspect two machines. The app adapts the script: show both role cards, one after the other.")
B.Ou=new A.ik(2,"C2 Server Down",B.jf,"Tonight","The attackers' Command & Control server is down. They can no longer coordinate and must act alone.","Tonight the Red Team (Purple included) is called one attacker at a time. If they all point at the same machine it is compromised, otherwise the attack fails.")
B.Os=new A.ik(3,"Honeypot",B.jf,"Tonight","The Blue Team has set up a decoy on the network: a machine that looks vulnerable but is a trap.","At nightfall the app secretly picks one online machine outside the Red Team. If the Red Team targets it, the attack fails. Tell nobody who the decoy is.")
B.Ot=new A.ik(4,"Power Outage",B.eD,"Tonight",u.B,"Tonight only the Red Team is called. No Threat Hunter, no Incident Responder, no Purple solo action, and the SOC Analyst cannot peek.")
B.Op=new A.ik(5,"Zero-Day",B.eD,"Tonight","The Red Team exploits an unknown flaw that is also present in the backups: restoring the machine is useless.","Tonight Backup Restore is unavailable. It is not used up: the Incident Responder keeps it for later. Kill Process still works.")
B.Ov=new A.ik(6,"Maintenance Window",B.eD,"Today","A planned maintenance window freezes every change on the network today.","The debate happens as usual. At the end, announce that no quarantine happens today. There is no vote.")
B.Ow=new A.ik(7,"Remote Work Day",B.eD,"Today","Everyone works from home. Nobody meets at the coffee machine, so there is no discussion.","No debate. Start the countdown right away: everyone points at a player in silence. Usual voting rules apply.")
B.Or=new A.ik(8,"Phishing Campaign",B.eE,"Today, effect tonight","A suspicious email lands in every inbox. Is it legitimate, or is it phishing?","The quiz shows an email. Everyone decides together: legitimate or phishing? Majority right: malus for the Red Team, their attack fails tonight. Majority wrong: bonus for the Red Team, they compromise 2 machines tonight.")
B.Ox=new A.ik(9,"Black Friday Rush",B.eE,"Today","It's Black Friday: everyone is swamped and nobody has time to talk.","The debate lasts only 1 minute. Then the vote happens as usual.")
B.Oy=new A.ik(10,"DDoS",B.eE,"Today","The network is flooded by a denial-of-service attack: only one message gets through at a time.","No free debate. One round, one player at a time, 1 minute each, starting with the player to the left of the CISO. Nobody can interrupt.")
B.aO=new A.c5([B.hl,B.Oq,B.dO,B.Ou,B.eB,B.Os,B.dh,B.Ot,B.eC,B.Op,B.hm,B.Ov,B.hn,B.Ow,B.bL,B.Or,B.je,B.Ox,B.di,B.Oy],A.ab("c5<fR,ik>"))
B.TV=s(["Find weaknesses before attackers do","Punish employees who made mistakes","Replace the antivirus"],t.s)
B.OC=new A.il("What is the main goal of a security audit?",B.TV,0,"An audit checks systems and habits to find security gaps, so they can be fixed before anyone exploits them.")
B.U1=s(["The company's main backup server","A server attackers use to control infected machines","A server that filters spam"],t.s)
B.OE=new A.il("What is a C2 (Command & Control) server?",B.U1,1,"Infected machines call home to the C2 server to receive orders. Without it, the attackers can no longer coordinate.")
B.S8=s(["A vault that stores passwords","A firewall rule that blocks all traffic","A decoy system that attracts and detects attackers"],t.s)
B.OJ=new A.il("What is a honeypot?",B.S8,2,"A honeypot looks like an easy target. Attackers who touch it reveal themselves while the defenders watch.")
B.SO=s(["A UPS (uninterruptible power supply)","A VPN","A proxy server"],t.s)
B.OB=new A.il("What keeps critical servers running during a power cut?",B.SO,0,"A UPS gives battery power long enough to switch to a generator or to shut the servers down safely.")
B.SG=s(["A flaw fixed on the day it is found","A flaw unknown to the vendor, with no patch yet","A virus that activates at midnight"],t.s)
B.OI=new A.il("What is a zero-day vulnerability?",B.SG,1,'Defenders have had "zero days" to fix it: no patch exists yet, which makes it very dangerous.')
B.TM=s(["To give employees a day off","To delete old accounts automatically","To install updates with minimal impact on users"],t.s)
B.OG=new A.il("Why do companies plan maintenance windows?",B.TM,2,"Patching on a planned schedule keeps systems secure without stopping people in the middle of their work.")
B.Ud=s(["Through the company VPN","Through free public Wi-Fi","With a colleague's account"],t.s)
B.OF=new A.il("What is the safest way to connect to the company network from home?",B.Ud,0,"A VPN encrypts the connection between your computer and the company network. Never share accounts.")
B.U9=s(["Click quickly before it expires","Report it to the IT / security team","Forward it to colleagues"],t.s)
B.OD=new A.il("You get an urgent email asking you to reset your password with a link. What do you do?",B.U9,1,"Urgency is a classic phishing trick. One report lets the security team block the email for everyone.")
B.U8=s(["Banks closing accounts","Free antivirus updates","Fake shopping sites with too-good-to-be-true deals"],t.s)
B.OA=new A.il("What is a common online scam during Black Friday?",B.U8,2,"Scammers copy real shops to steal payment details. Always check the website address before paying.")
B.Te=s(["Floods a service with traffic so it becomes unavailable","Steals passwords from a database","Encrypts files and asks for a ransom"],t.s)
B.OH=new A.il("What does a DDoS attack do?",B.Te,0,"Thousands of machines send requests at the same time until the service can no longer answer. Encrypting files for a ransom is ransomware.")
B.VY=new A.c5([B.hl,B.OC,B.dO,B.OE,B.eB,B.OJ,B.dh,B.OB,B.eC,B.OI,B.hm,B.OG,B.hn,B.OF,B.bL,B.OD,B.je,B.OA,B.di,B.OH],A.ab("c5<fR,il>"))
B.Oi=new A.ij("An external audit boosts the investigation.","The Threat Hunter inspects **2 machines** instead of 1.","TONIGHT")
B.Oj=new A.ij("The attackers' Command & Control server is down.","Attackers are woken **one at a time** and point alone. The target goes down only if they **all** chose the same machine.","TONIGHT")
B.Og=new A.ij("A decoy machine waits on the network.",'The Narrator secretly picks a decoy (not Red Team). If the Red Team targets it, the attack **fails**: "Honeypot triggered."',"TONIGHT")
B.Oh=new A.ij(u.B,"Only the Red Team acts. **All special powers are offline**, and the SOC Analyst cannot peek.","TONIGHT")
B.Of=new A.ij("An unknown flaw, even in the backups.","**Backup Restore cannot be used** (it is not used up). Kill Process still works.","TONIGHT")
B.Oe=new A.ij("Planned maintenance freezes the network.","Debate as usual, then **no vote and no quarantine** today.","TODAY")
B.Od=new A.ij("No coffee machine, no discussion.","**No debate.** Everyone votes immediately, in silence.","TODAY")
B.Oc=new A.ij("Legit or phishing?","Everyone checks the same email. **Majority right**: the Red Team's attack **fails** tonight. **Majority wrong**: the Red Team compromises **2 machines** tonight.","TODAY")
B.Ol=new A.ij("Everyone is swamped.","The debate lasts only **1 minute**.","TODAY")
B.Ok=new A.ij("One message at a time.","No free debate. Each player speaks **once, in turn**, 1 minute max.","TODAY")
B.jR=new A.c5([B.hl,B.Oi,B.dO,B.Oj,B.eB,B.Og,B.dh,B.Oh,B.eC,B.Of,B.hm,B.Oe,B.hn,B.Od,B.bL,B.Oc,B.je,B.Ol,B.di,B.Ok],A.ab("c5<fR,ij>"))
