B.TH=s(["From Day 2, after the morning report, the app draws an Event. The Narrator reads its name.","The app shows a **quiz question** about this threat, with **3 answers**. The Narrator reads it.","Players think for 1 minute without talking.",'On "3, 2, 1", every player still in the game shows **1, 2 or 3 fingers** at the same time.',"The app shows the right answer and a short explanation.","The result decides the Event."],t.s)
B.a9U=new A.kI(B.TH,!0,null)
B.Tf=s(["Players sit in a circle. The Narrator sits where they can see everyone.","The Narrator enters the players in this app. The app recommends the composition (about 1 attacker for every 4 players).","The Narrator deals one role card face down to each player. Players look at their card and keep it face down.","The Narrator starts the first night."],t.s)
B.a9V=new A.kI(B.Tf,!0,null)
B.SA=s(["Show their role card.","Stay silent: no hints, no reactions, no vote, no quiz answer.","Keep their eyes closed at night."],t.s)
B.a9W=new A.kI(B.SA,!1,null)
B.Uf=s(["Everyone closes their eyes.","**Network Engineer**: points at 2 players. The Narrator taps them; they open their eyes, recognise each other, then close them.","**Threat Hunter**: points at a player and sees their card.","**Red Team** (with the Purple Team): silently agree on a target and point at it. The SOC Analyst may peek.","**Incident Responder**: sees the victim. Thumb up or down for Backup Restore, and may point at a player for Kill Process."],t.s)
B.a9X=new A.kI(B.Uf,!0,null)
B.Uc=s(["At night, players never speak: they point, and the Narrator nods.","Call every role that was dealt, even if its player is out. Wait a few seconds each time.","Same tone and same timing every time. Don't look at the players who are acting."],t.s)
B.a9Y=new A.kI(B.Uc,!1,null)
B.SW=s(["**Threat Hunter**: inspects a player.","**Red Team** (with the Purple Team): choose a target.","**Purple Team**, alone, every second night: may eliminate a Red Team member.","**Incident Responder**: may use their remaining powers."],t.s)
B.a9Z=new A.kI(B.SW,!0,null)
B.RY=s(["**5 to 14 players** + 1 **Narrator** who runs the game and does not play.","1 role card per player.","10 Event cards, each with a quiz question (Expert mode).","This app: script for the Narrator, timers, quiz and game tracking.","A game lasts **15 to 40 minutes**."],t.s)
B.aa_=new A.kI(B.RY,!1,null)
B.St=s(["**Morning report**: the Narrator says who was compromised. Eliminated players show their card.","**Chain reactions**: Dead Man's Switch, VPN Tunnel.","**Day 1 only**: elect the CISO.","**Expert mode, from Day 2**: Event + quiz (see below).",'**Debate**, then **vote**: on "3, 2, 1", everyone points at a player. Most votes = quarantined. The CISO\'s vote counts double.',"**Tie**: the CISO decides. Without a CISO, nobody is quarantined.","The quarantined player shows their card. Chain reactions apply. If no team has won, night falls again."],t.s)
